<h2 class=3D"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5">Where State Mana=
gement is Heading</h2>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Based on my analysis of the ecos=
ystem and experience with different patterns:</p>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">1. <strong>Atomi=
c State Management</strong> is gaining traction</h3>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Jotai</strong> and <str=
ong>Valtio</strong> are showing the way forward</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Bottom-up composition</=
strong> instead of top-down structure</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Granular reactivity</st=
rong> for better performance</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">2. <strong>Type-=
safe State Management</strong> is becoming essential</h3>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Zustand with TypeScript=
</strong> is excellent</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Redux Toolkit with RTK =
Query</strong> provides end-to-end type safety</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Jotai</strong> has exce=
llent TypeScript integration</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">3. <strong>Serve=
r State Abstraction</strong> is maturing</h3>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>TanStack Query</strong>=
 (formerly React Query) is becoming the standard</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>SWR</strong> for simple=
r use cases</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Apollo Client</strong> =
for GraphQL ecosystems</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">4. <strong>Signa=
l-based Reactivity</strong> is the future</h3>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Signals</strong> (inspi=
red by SolidJS) are coming to React</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Fine-grained reactivity=
</strong> without React's reconciliation overhead</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Valtio</strong> and <st=
rong>Jotai</strong> are pioneering this approach</li>
</ul>
