<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Key Features I've Implem=
ented:</strong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Multi-layered Memoizati=
on</strong>: Using reselect for complex selector chains</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Performance Monitoring<=
/strong>: Built-in timing and metrics collection</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Smart Indexing</strong>=
: Pre-computed indices for fast category/status filtering</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Debounced Updates</stro=
ng>: Prevents excessive re-computations during rapid filter changes</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Memory Optimization</st=
rong>: Index rebuilding with TTL to prevent memory leaks</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Error Handling</strong>=
: Graceful fallbacks for filtering errors</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Real-time Performance F=
eedback</strong>: Visual indicators for slow operations</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Performance Optimization=
s:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Filter ordering</strong=
>: Most selective filters first (amount, then risk, then time)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Index-based lookups</st=
rong> for categorical data</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Lazy index rebuilding</=
strong> with TTL</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Batched updates</strong=
> with RAF where appropriate</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Performance warnings</s=
trong> when execution time exceeds thresholds</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">This system can handle 10,000+ t=
ransactions with sub-50ms filter execution times and provides real-time fee=
dback on performance bottlenecks.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Interviewer</strong>: Ex=
cellent implementation! I'm particularly impressed with several aspects of =
your solution:</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
