<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>The performance monitor=
ing integration</strong> - This shows real production thinking where you ne=
ed to monitor and optimize continuously</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Your smart indexing str=
ategy</strong> - The TTL-based index rebuilding is exactly what we need for=
 long-running applications</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>The filter ordering opt=
imization</strong> - Putting the most selective filters first shows deep un=
derstanding of performance characteristics</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>The debouncing with imm=
ediate override</strong> - This balance between performance and user experi=
ence is crucial</li>
</ol>
